Method nextElementSibling() returns null after adding an element to a document that was cloned


<p dir="auto">If I clone a document, and add an element by the method <code class="notranslate">after()</code>, and try to get the new element by the method <code class="notranslate">nextElementSibling()</code> I get null. In the same time the method <code class="notranslate">nextSibling()</code> successfully returns this element.<br/>
If I do the same with the original document everything is fine.</p>
